abstract: >-
  Interactive explorer of entry, exit and net change in U.S. organic certification by state,
  certification scope, commodity group and certifier, 2018 to 2026, built on The U.S. Organic
  Certification Panel (USDA Organic INTEGRITY Database snapshots).
